'''Maintenance''' (Japanese: '''メンテナンス''' ''Maintenance'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Shuffle 2 cards from your hand into your deck. Draw a card, If you can't shuffle in 2 cards, you can't use this card.
}}

==Trivia==
*This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Furious Fists}} print of the {{TCG|Maintenance}} card from the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Furious Fists|Maintenance|96}} from the {{TCG|Furious Fists}} expansion.

